llective voice. Percentage Of Time 80 Responsibility / Duty Service: Responsibilities include service to the University, College, Department, Program, the community, and beyond. Service is integral and includes key functions such as advising and mentoring students, providing service in the form of committee work at all levels both internal and external to the University and Department, professional organizations, leading groups, and more. Percentage Of Time 10 Responsibility / Duty Research: Responsibilities include a commitment to scholarly activity. Activities include, but are not limited to, publications, original research, grant writing, presentations, and more. Scholarly work should support the educational environment through respective research, teaching, and/or service. Percentage Of Time 10 Posting Detail Information Minimum Experience Required At least two years of clinical practice Minimum Education Required MSN or MN Minimum Licenses Required Current unencumbered/unrestricted LA RN license Other Minimum Requirements Test(s) Required Preferred Education Doctoral prepared: PhD, DNS , EdD, DNP Preferred Experience Mental health nursing Preferred Licenses Other Preferred Requirements BLS , ACLS certified Physical Demands Fit for duty in lab and clinical setting Employment Year Academic Year If Grant Period or Specified Period selected, please specify begin date If Grant Period or Specified Period selected, please specify end date Employment Basis Full-time Proposed Ending Date (for faculty and grant funded positions) 05/15/2027 Posting Date 09/02/2026 Closing Date 12/31/2026 Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link for Postings https://jobs.nicholls.edu/postings/10398 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Resume/CV Cover Letter Teaching Philosophy Names and Contact Information for a Minimum of THREE References Letter of Reference 1 Letter of Reference 2 Letter of Reference 